OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged after six people found
OL,4,Ain lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and a woman have been charged
OL,7,Fafter six people were found in the back
OL,8,Fof a lorry in Goole, police have said.
OL,10,FHumberside Police said 27-year-old
OL,11,FFlorin Anghel, who identifies as
OL,12,FItalian, and 24-year-old Tita Istrate,
OL,13,Fwho identifies as Romanian, have been
OL,14,Fcharged with doing an act to facilitate
OL,15,Fthe commission of a breach of UK
OL,16,Fimmigrational law by a non-UK national.
OL,18,FThe force said it attended a vehicle on
OL,19,FAnderson Road at about 18:00 GMT on
OL,20,FTuesday. Six people have also been
OL,21,Fdetained under the immigration act.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
